动大军攻打汉中！？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&士兵01\n是的，曹洪将军请您马上派兵增援。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n孔明终于行动了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n汉中守军支持不了几天，\n我们必须马上增援。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好！马上率领大军增援汉中。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n可是主公，如果大队人马移动，\n只怕会来不及救援。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，只好派脚程快的先头部队了。\n妙才！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[6,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯渊\n在。\n&曹操\n命你指挥先头部队，\n即刻赶往汉中增援，\n我率大队人马随后就到。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[6,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯渊\n喔，孟德放心吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[6,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n看你的了，夏侯渊。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":5,"offset":7480,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":7482,"title":"无理","body_off":7497,"body_end":8532,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["无理"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,64,65535]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[205,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[8,60,64,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[137,60,60,3,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,137,0,55,60,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","